" ┌ Create your vault ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ "
" │ courier-ftp keeps your sites, passwords, history and trusted keys          │ "
" │ encrypted on this device. The master password is the only key; with sync   │ "
" │ it is also the account password.                                           │ "
" │                                                                            │ "
" │ Master password:                                                           │ "
" │ Confirm:                                                                   │ "
" │ Strength:         ░░░░ —                                                   │ "
" │                   At least “strong” is required.                           │ "
" │ [ ] Unlock with system keyring on this device                              │ "
" │     The keyring is also the only local recovery path.                      │ "
" │ ⚠ Without the keyring option or a sync account (which gives you a recovery │ "
" │ key), a forgotten password means your saved sites are lost.                │ "
" │                                                                            │ "
" │     [ Set password ]  [ Restore backup… ]  [ Continue without vault ]      │ "
